<SECTION image-layout="blank">
  <DIV class="body">
    <H1 style="text-align: left">Critical Challenges Facing the Sector</H1>
    <SMART-LAYOUT variant="outlineBoxes" cellSize="15" horizontalAlign="left">
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4>Early-Stage Funding Valley of Death</H4>
        <P>Series A climate tech deals drop 40% in 2024. Average time from prototype to commercial scale: 8-12 years. Hardware startups need $50-100M before revenue, far exceeding typical VC appetite.</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4>Regulatory Fragmentation</H4>
        <P>Carbon credit standards vary across 15+ certification bodies. EU's CBAM affects $150B in trade, but implementation differs by member state. US state-level policies create 50 different compliance frameworks.</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4>Manufacturing Scale Bottlenecks</H4>
        <P>Battery gigafactory construction takes 3-5 years, limiting EV growth. Solar panel supply concentrated in China (80% global capacity). Skilled technician shortage delays wind farm installations by 6-18 months.</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
      <SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
        <H4>Specialized Talent Shortage</H4>
        <P>Clean energy jobs grow 67% faster than overall economy, but engineering programs lag. Battery chemistry PhDs command $300K+ salaries. Carbon accounting specialists see 200% salary increases since 2022.</P>
      </SMART-LAYOUT-ITEM>
    </SMART-LAYOUT>
  </DIV>
</SECTION>